WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.800 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Obama: I can tell you that some election nights are more fun than others.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.900 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Some are exhilarating.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.100 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Some are humbling.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.900 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>But, I mean, I think it’s important to point out as well

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:20.100 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>that a couple of great communicators, Ronald Reagan and Bill Clinton,

6
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.400 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>were standing at this podium two years into their Presidency

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.300 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>getting very similar questions…

8
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.600 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Now, I’m not recommending for every future President

9
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.800 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>that they take a shellacking like they— like I did last night.

10
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.100 line:-2
[Laughter]

11
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.100 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>I’m sure there are easier ways to learn these lessons.
